# Line endings
#
# Normalise text files to LF in the repository and check them out with the
# convention of the working platform. Without this, a file committed from a
# Windows checkout keeps its CRLF endings in the repository, and any editor
# that rewrites them turns a one-line change into a whole-file diff.
* text=auto

# Image sources are carried verbatim: they are written by drawing tools that
# compare their output byte for byte, and their line endings carry no meaning
# for a reader of this repository.
*.svg -text

# Binary assets
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.xz  binary
